		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A 30-foot-tall night-black revenant with ram horns. General of undead legions.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 49, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +9 (3d6 + sunder) or finger of death, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Finger of Death</strong>. One target of LV 9 or less within far CON 15+ or go to 0 HP. Mortals slain rise as zombies in 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunder</strong>. Items or objects struck are destroyed on a d6 roll of 1-3.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
